<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MacShot - Capture Mode Wireframe</title>
    <style>
        /* ========================================
           MacShot Design System - Capture Mode
           macOS 15 Sequoia Style
           ======================================== */

        /* CSS Variables - Design Tokens */
        :root {
            /* Colors - Light Mode */
            --bg-primary: #F5F5F7;
            --bg-secondary: #FFFFFF;
            --text-primary: #000000;
            --text-secondary: #3C3C42;
            --text-tertiary: #828287;
            --accent: #007AFF;
            --accent-hover: #1F8FFF;
            --border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            --separator: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);

            /* Spacing - 8pt Grid */
            --space-1: 4px;
            --space-2: 8px;
            --space-3: 12px;
            --space-4: 16px;
            --space-5: 20px;
            --space-6: 24px;
            --space-7: 32px;
            --space-8: 40px;
            --space-9: 48px;

            /* Typography */
            --font-large-title: 34px;
            --font-title: 28px;
            --font-title2: 22px;
            --font-title3: 20px;
            --font-headline: 17px;
            --font-body: 17px;
            --font-caption: 12px;
            --font-caption2: 11px;

            /* macOS Materials */
            --ultra-thin-material: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            --thin-material: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);

            /* Border Radius */
            --radius-small: 6px;
            --radius-medium: 10px;
            --radius-large: 12px;
        }

        /* Dark Mode Support */
        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            :root {
                --bg-primary: #1E1E1E;
                --bg-secondary: #2C2C2E;
                --text-primary: #FFFFFF;
                --text-secondary: #EBEBF5;
                --text-tertiary: #98989D;
                --accent: #0A84FF;
                --accent-hover: #409CFF;
                --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
                --separator: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
                --ultra-thin-material: rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.85);
                --thin-material: rgba(44, 44, 46, 0.9);
            }
        }

        /* Reset & Base */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Display', 'SF Pro Text', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: var(--space-8);
        }

        /* ========================================
           Floating Capture Panel
           ======================================== */
        .capture-panel {
            background: var(--ultra-thin-material);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%);
            border-radius: var(--radius-large);
            padding: var(--space-4);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            max-width: 280px;
            width: 100%;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.3s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .panel-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
            padding-bottom: var(--space-3);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--separator);
        }

        .panel-title {
            font-size: var(--font-title3);
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }

        .panel-subtitle {
            font-size: var(--font-caption);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-top: var(--space-1);
        }

        /* ========================================
           Capture Mode Buttons
           ======================================== */
        .capture-modes {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: var(--space-2);
        }

        .capture-button {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: var(--space-3);
            padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-medium);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            min-height: 44px; /* Touch target */
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .capture-button:hover {
            background: var(--accent);
            border-color: var(--accent);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .capture-button:active {
            transform: translateY(0) scale(0.98);
        }

        .capture-button:focus {
            outline: none;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0, 122, 255, 0.3);
        }

        /* Icon styling */
        .capture-icon {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            border-radius: var(--radius-small);
            flex-shrink: 0;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .capture-button:hover .capture-icon {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .capture-icon svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            fill: var(--text-primary);
            transition: fill 0.2s ease;
        }

        .capture-button:hover .capture-icon svg {
            fill: #FFFFFF;
        }

        /* Button content */
        .button-content {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .button-title {
            font-size: var(--font-body);
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            letter-spacing: -0.2px;
        }

        .capture-button:hover .button-title {
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }

        .button-description {
            font-size: var(--font-caption);
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
            margin-top: 1px;
        }

        .capture-button:hover .button-description {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        }

        /* Keyboard shortcut badge */
        .shortcut-badge {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: var(--space-1);
            padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            border-radius: var(--radius-small);
            font-size: var(--font-caption2);
            font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .capture-button:hover .shortcut-badge {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }

        /* ========================================
           Panel Footer
           ======================================== */
        .panel-footer {
            margin-top: var(--space-4);
            padding-top: var(--space-3);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--separator);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .footer-info {
            font-size: var(--font-caption);
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
        }

        .settings-link {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: var(--space-1);
            padding: var(--space-2);
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            border-radius: var(--radius-small);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            font-size: var(--font-caption);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .settings-link:hover {
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .settings-link svg {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            fill: currentColor;
        }

        /* ========================================
           Annotations / Documentation
           ======================================== */
        .annotation {
            position: absolute;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            color: #FFF;
            padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);
            border-radius: var(--radius-small);
            font-size: var(--font-caption);
            pointer-events: none;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        /* ========================================
           Responsive Design
           ======================================== */
        @media (max-width: 320px) {
            .capture-panel {
                padding: var(--space-3);
            }

            .capture-button {
                padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
            }

            .capture-icon {
                width: 28px;
                height: 28px;
            }

            .shortcut-badge {
                display: none; /* Hide shortcuts on very small screens */
            }
        }

        /* ========================================
           Accessibility Enhancements
           ======================================== */
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .capture-panel,
            .capture-button,
            .settings-link {
                animation: none;
                transition: none;
            }
        }

        .sr-only {
            position: absolute;
            width: 1px;
            height: 1px;
            padding: 0;
            margin: -1px;
            overflow: hidden;
            clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
            white-space: nowrap;
            border: 0;
        }

        /* Focus visible for keyboard navigation */
        :focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
            outline-offset: 2px;
        }

        /* High contrast mode support */
        @media (prefers-contrast: high) {
            .capture-button {
                border-width: 2px;
            }

            .shortcut-badge {
                border: 1px solid var(--text-primary);
            }
        }

        /* ========================================
           Design Notes (for reference)
           ======================================== */
        .design-notes {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: var(--space-4);
            right: var(--space-4);
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            padding: var(--space-3);
            border-radius: var(--radius-medium);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            font-size: var(--font-caption);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            max-width: 250px;
        }

        .design-notes h4 {
            font-size: var(--font-caption);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .design-notes ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .design-notes li {
            margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
            padding-left: var(--space-3);
            position: relative;
        }

        .design-notes li:before {
            content: '•';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--accent);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- ========================================
         Capture Mode Floating Panel
         ======================================== -->
    <div class="capture-panel" role="dialog" aria-label="Capture Mode Selection">
        <!-- Panel Header -->
        <div class="panel-header">
            <h1 class="panel-title">Choose Capture Mode</h1>
            <p class="panel-subtitle">Select how you want to capture</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Capture Mode Buttons -->
        <div class="capture-modes">
            <!-- Fullscreen Capture -->
            <button class="capture-button" aria-label="Capture Fullscreen. Press Command Shift F">
                <div class="capture-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/>
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
                        <line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="5"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="button-content">
                    <span class="button-title">Fullscreen</span>
                    <span class="button-description">Capture entire screen</span>
                </div>
                <div class="shortcut-badge">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">⌘⇧F</span>
                    <span class="sr-only">Command Shift F</span>
                </div>
            </button>

            <!-- Region Capture -->
            <button class="capture-button" aria-label="Capture Region. Press Command Shift R">
                <div class="capture-icon">
                    <!-- SF Symbol: rectangle.dashed -->
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 18 18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M3 2.5c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v2c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5v-2c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5Zm3 0c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v2c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5v-2c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5Zm3 0c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v2c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5v-2c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5Zm3 0c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v2c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5v-2c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5Zm3 0c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v2c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5v-2c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5ZM2.5 6c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v3c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5.5v-3c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5Zm0 4c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v3c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5.5v-3c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5Zm13-4c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v3c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5.5v-3c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5Zm0 4c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v3c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5.5v-3c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5ZM3 12.5c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v2c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5.5v-2c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5Zm3 0c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v2c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5.5v-2c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5Zm3 0c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v2c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5.5v-2c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5Zm3 0c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v2c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5.5v-2c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5Zm3 0c-.276 0-.5.224-.5.5v2c0 .276.224.5.5.5s.5-.224.5-.5.5v-2c0-.276-.224-.5-.5-.5Z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="button-content">
                    <span class="button-title">Region</span>
                    <span class="button-description">Select custom area</span>
                </div>
                <div class="shortcut-badge">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">⌘⇧R</span>
                    <span class="sr-only">Command Shift R</span>
                </div>
            </button>

            <!-- Window Capture -->
            <button class="capture-button" aria-label="Capture Window. Press Command Shift W">
                <div class="capture-icon">
                    <!-- SF Symbol: window.loop -->
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 18 18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M3 3C2.44772 3 2 3.44772 2 4V14C2 14.5523 2.44772 15 3 15H15C15.5523 15 16 14.5523 16 14V4C16 3.44772 15.5523 3 15 3H3ZM3 4H15V6H3V4ZM3 7H15V14H3V7ZM4 5H5V5.5H4V5ZM6 5H7V5.5H6V5Z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="button-content">
                    <span class="button-title">Window</span>
                    <span class="button-description">Capture specific window</span>
                </div>
                <div class="shortcut-badge">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">⌘⇧W</span>
                    <span class="sr-only">Command Shift W</span>
                </div>
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Panel Footer -->
        <div class="panel-footer">
            <span class="footer-info">Click or use shortcut</span>
            <button class="settings-link" aria-label="Open Settings">
                <!-- SF Symbol: gear -->
                <svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M6.972 2.328a.5.5 0 00-.484-.328H5.502a.5.5 0 00-.494.303l-.388.776a.5.5 0 01-.285.253l-.844.282a.5.5 0 01-.527-.1l-.715-.477a.5.5 0 00-.587.046l-.735.735a.5.5 0 00-.046.587l.477.715a.5.5 0 01.1.527l-.282.844a.5.5 0 01-.253.285l-.776.388a.5.5 0 00-.303.494v1.036a.5.5 0 00.328.484l.776.388a.5.5 0 01.253.285l.282.844a.5.5 0 01-.1.527l-.477.715a.5.5 0 00.046.587l.735.735a.5.5 0 00.587.046l.715-.477a.5.5 0 01.527.1l.844.282a.5.5 0 01.285.253l.388.776a.5.5 0 00.494.303h1.036a.5.5 0 00.484-.328l.388-.776a.5.5 0 01.285-.253l.844-.282a.5.5 0 01.527.1l.715.477a.5.5 0 00.587-.046l.735-.735a.5.5 0 00.046-.587l-.477-.715a.5.5 0 01-.1-.527l.282-.844a.5.5 0 01.253-.285l.776-.388a.5.5 0 00.328-.494V5.502a.5.5 0 00-.328-.484l-.776-.388a.5.5 0 01-.253-.285l-.282-.844a.5.5 0 01.1-.527l.477-.715a.5.5 0 00-.046-.587l-.735-.735a.5.5 0 00-.587-.046l-.715.477a.5.5 0 01-.527-.1l-.844-.282a.5.5 0 01-.285-.253l-.388-.776zM7 4.5a2.5 2.5 0 100 5 2.5 2.5 0 000-5z"/>
                </svg>
                Settings
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Design Notes (for developer reference) -->
    <div class="design-notes">
        <h4>Design Specifications</h4>
        <ul>
            <li>Floating panel with ultraThinMaterial</li>
            <li>44pt minimum touch targets</li>
            <li>SF Symbols: camera.fill, rectangle.dashed, window.loop</li>
            <li>Keyboard shortcuts shown in monospace font</li>
            <li>Hover states with scale and shadow</li>
            <li>Auto dark mode via prefers-color-scheme</li>
            <li>Reduced motion support</li>
            <li>WCAG 2.1 AA contrast ratios</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</body>
